       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-COLLECTIVE-PRIMITIVES.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COLLECTIVE-PRIMITIVES-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ALLGATHER-RING-BIJECT    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REDUCESCATTER-LOCAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BROADCAST-DETERMINISTIC  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ALLTOALL-CROSSBAR-BOUND  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BARRIER-ZERO-DEADLOCK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-COLLECTIVE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-COLLECTIVES-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-COLLECTIVE-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GATHER-SCATTER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BROADCAST-AND-ALLTOALL.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-BARRIER-SAFETY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-COLLECTIVES.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GATHER-SCATTER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALLGATHER-RING-BIJECT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REDUCESCATTER-LOCAL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BROADCAST-AND-ALLTOALL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BROADCAST-DETERMINISTIC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALLTOALL-CROSSBAR-BOUND.
       3000-EVALUATE-BARRIER-SAFETY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BARRIER-ZERO-DEADLOCK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-COLLECTIVES.
           IF WS-ALLGATHER-RING-BIJECT = 1 AND
              WS-REDUCESCATTER-LOCAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-BROADCAST-DETERMINISTIC = 1 AND
              WS-ALLTOALL-CROSSBAR-BOUND = 1 AND
              WS-BARRIER-ZERO-DEADLOCK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-COLLECTIVES-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-COLLECTIVE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-COLLECTIVES-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-COLLECTIVE-CODE.
